      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T00:42:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I worry that there are two possible ways to interpret this sentence and that the difference between those interpretations may lead to confusion.  They are:\n1. you must have discussed the technical aspects of the version of the specification that you\u0027re planning to ship\n2. you must have discussed the technical aspects *and the shipping plans* of the version of the specification that you\u0027re planning to ship\n\nI think it literally says (1) and I think that\u0027s probably what you intended, but I think some people may read it as (2), given how close \"discuss\" is to \"planning to ship\".",
      "revId": "0f6dd219ce1704b7a2a4fe5978edbd64cacdff2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8818f6d5_f6bd1545",
        "filename": "site/blink/launching-features/index.md",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 413,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T03:25:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you think the right way to disambiguate is to add a second sentence like \"Note that you don\u0027t need the WG\u0027s agreement that the feature is ready to ship.\"? Or is there some other way to clarify this?",
      "parentUuid": "349bb2e0_dbce1400",
      "revId": "0f6dd219ce1704b7a2a4fe5978edbd64cacdff2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3e94e39f_daa4e58d",
        "filename": "site/blink/launching-features/index.md",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 413,
      "author": {
        "id": 1497432
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T14:53:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there\u0027s probably a more lightweight way to clarify.  Perhaps it would help to change \"version\" to \"feature\" or \"state of the feature\", or perhaps change \"version you\u0027re planning to ship\" to \"current state of the feature\" (or maybe that but replacing \"state of\" with \"specification for\").  One of these changes might also be helpful to clarify the case where the feature is a small part of a larger specification.",
      "parentUuid": "8818f6d5_f6bd1545",
      "revId": "0f6dd219ce1704b7a2a4fe5978edbd64cacdff2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "03b6e154_5b63a60e",
        "filename": "site/blink/launching-features/index.md",
