        "id": 1001949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T22:03:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve tried \"discuss the latest specification for the feature\". (The point of the \"latest\" here is to avoid cases where the feature owner discusses one version, makes the changes the the WG asked for, but then doesn\u0027t present the new version to the WG before shipping to make sure folks have a chance to notice any new problems.) How\u0027s this?",
      "parentUuid": "3e94e39f_daa4e58d",
      "revId": "0f6dd219ce1704b7a2a4fe5978edbd64cacdff2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
